Û ez meselekî.. ez dê bêjim gund... gundî me.. vira na..
firn tine..
 
And I an issue.. I will say village... our village.. here
no.. there is no bakery..

174
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:55,000
Mesela.. ez çep ê diçim wura.. gundê min e.. gundê xweşik
e.. gundê xwaş e.. bi çakî tu.. qet nanekê...
 
For example.. I go left there.. it's my village.. it's a
beautiful village.. it's a nice village.. with goodness
